WEBVTT

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.070
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.740
<i>Palmon.</i>

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.200
LEVEL: ROOKIE

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>This Digimon is Mimi-san's partner.</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.740
TYPE: PLANT

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:22.750
<i>The flower on Palmon's head and
the leaf-like arms allow photosynthesis.</i>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.250
SPECIAL MOVE: POISON IVY

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.920
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.960
<i>The flower on the head changes scents
depending on Palmon's mood.</i>

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.680
<i>I want to see how different it smells
when Palmon is happy or angry!</i>

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.940
<i>To avoid the swamp emitting dark miasma,</i>

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.770
<i>the Chosen Ones decide
to split into two teams to proceed.</i>

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:21.240
<i>Along their way, Yamato's team
encounters Neamon and other Digimon</i>

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.410
<i>who were trying to escape the desert
dominated by Scorpiomon.</i>

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.120
<i>During the battle to help them,</i>

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:33.920
<i>Garurumon succeeds in evolving
into Weregarurumon.</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.300
<i>Meanwhile, on Taichi's side...</i>

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.260
Huh? No way!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.770
LILIMON BLOOMS

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.360
Ow, ow, ow...

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.030
-What was all that?!
-Mimi...

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.030
You're heavy...

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.780
Oh, sorry!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.830
Taichi-san!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.910
Koshiro-kun!

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.130
Stay back, Mimi.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.890
Looks like it's too high...

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.400
Anyhow, let's find a way to get back up!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.020
Mimi!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.950
Palmon!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.200
Can you hear us?!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.170
It's no use...

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:54.000
It might be because of this ruin.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:59.000
I think the characters I took photos of
earlier are information on this ruin.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.130
They could be a clue to finding them...

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:03.930
Oh!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.390
Recently, it's been acting up a bit...

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.850
Oh... looks like it's fine now.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.520
I've got it!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.150
Seems like an ancient weapon factory
was underneath here.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.780
A weapon factory?

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.160
I've got a bad feeling...

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.020
This is...

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.890
Looks like a pile of scrap metal.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.230
Scrap?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.030
What?!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.950
Could all of these be...

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.410
Digimon?!

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.800
You're all covered in dust.
Poor thing...

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.470
Let's go, Palmo...

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.850
Huh?!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.160
Oh... we're sorry to intrude.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.730
Um...

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:46.160
You wouldn't know of a way
to get back to the surface, would you?

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:51.240
If you do, we'd appreciate it
if you could tell... us...

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.790
Target confirmed.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.700
What?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.540
Eliminate.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.460
Mimi!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.050
ANDROMON

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.360
What's with this guy?!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.220
I don't know...

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.020
Palmon Evolution!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.440
Togemon!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.990
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.250
Eliminate.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.820
Mimi...

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.670
I'll protect you!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:53.930
Togemon!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.560
Eliminate.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.790
What is it?!

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.980
What do you think you are doing,
Guardromon No. 2078?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.300
GUARDROMON

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.010
You're going to help us?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.780
Where are you aiming?!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.800
Palmon... Palmon!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.100
I need to do something.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.480
Hup...

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.910
You okay, Agumon?!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.490
Yeah, Taichi!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.990
This hole... goes further down!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.160
Keep on going!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.620
Hang on, Mimi-chan!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.630
Where...

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.660
For me?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.420
Really...

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:11.840
Thank you.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:25.310
Say, do you know of a stairway
or an elevator that goes up?

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.440
You do? Then guide us please!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.610
Now, we can rejoin Taichi-san
and everybody!

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.950
Eliminate.

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:57.800
What's the matter, Sora?

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.140
Are you worried about Neamon's group?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.470
Sora, let's focus on
what we need to do first.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:10.310
That's what'll lead to their peace.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.400
Believe that and move forward.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:13.900
That's true.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.490
Y-Yeah, what a cool thing to say...

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:19.150
Huh? What's with you, Joe?

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.240
No, nothin...

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.840
Mimi-chan!

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:25.910
Hey!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.410
Koshiro-san, look!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.920
Soundbirdmon!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.290
Even in a place like this...

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.640
What are these guys?

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:43.800
Probably Digimon
that were created here!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.800
HAGURUMON

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.930
This doesn't look good!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.930
They're being controlled by Soundbirdmon!

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.730
We have no choice.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.560
Agumon!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.780
Agumon Evolution!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.210
Greymon!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.630
Mega Flame!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.260
Is this...

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.520
an elevator?

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.490
Thank you! Now, we can finally get back
to the surface!

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.700
What?!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.370
Eliminate.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.420
Gatling Missile, activate!

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.550
Eliminate.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.030
Eliminate.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.330
Spiral Sword!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.850
Eliminate.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.910
Mimi-san, are you all right?!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.200
Koshiro-kun!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.950
Taichi-san and Greymon will come soon!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.460
Palmon!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.960
Mimi... are you okay?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.500
Yeah.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.130
Be careful, Kabuterimon!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.390
That's Andromon...

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.060
an Ultimate Digimon!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.230
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.400
It's no use...

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.160
Tentomon!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.910
Eliminate.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.790
Spiral...

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:03.420
-Swor--
-Mega Flame!

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.420
Is everyone okay?!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.550
Somehow...

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.810
Eliminate.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.230
Greymon!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.030
Mega Flame!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.240
Greymon...

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:53.010
Super Evolution!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.400
Metalgreymon!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.330
Mimi!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.330
Yeah!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.960
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.050
Metalgreymon!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.380
Yeah...

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.430
Giga Storm!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.710
Metalgreymon!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.050
Gatling Missile!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.510
Rapid-fire mode!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.770
Mimi!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.860
Is everyone all right?!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.700
Somehow...

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.910
Eliminate.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.830
Eliminate.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.080
I won't forgive you...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.120
Anyone but you...

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:19.470
I won't ever forgive you for this! Ever!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.310
Togemon Super Evolution!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.360
Lilimon!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.240
LILIMON

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:44.990
Lilimon?

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.490
Mimi, your sorrow...

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.250
And your anger...

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.000
is what made me evolve!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.000
Gatling Missile!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.140
Where are you looking at?!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.980
Spiral Sword!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.520
Target locking...

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.150
Failed.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.820
Gatling Missile!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.950
Take Mimi's pain!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.370
Flower Cannon!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.090
What...

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:45.890
What have I been...

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:00.610
Mimi...

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:26.180
According to the records, the Digimon
who protected Mimi-san was Guardromon.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:30.810
Guardromon and Andromon
were comrades initially.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:34.100
But Andromon was manipulated
and this was the result...

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.480
Are you okay now, Mimi?

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:41.930
Yeah.

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:45.280
We have to defeat the bad guys
as soon as possible!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.660
Let's go!

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.490
Right!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.260
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.260
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.080
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.080
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.510
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.510
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.590
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.590
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>ima nara kitto sora mo toberu kara</i>

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:04.070
<i>A great adventure
within a floating fortress!</i>

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:07.950
<i>Sora's love brings about
a new glow for Piyomon.</i>

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Garudamon of the Crimson Wings"</i>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.950
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
